========================================
Correction pass — 2026-07-18
========================================

--- Fix 1: Unconditional cross-host escalation ---
- Cross-host claim lock: unconditional CROSS_HOST_LOCK escalation before any PID check
- Cross-host supervisor lock: unconditional CROSS_HOST_SUPERVISOR_LOCK escalation
- Cross-host heartbeat: unconditional CROSS_HOST_HEARTBEAT escalation
- Never use isPidAlive() on cross-host artifacts

--- Fix 2: GitHub label verification ---
- Added correctLabelsWithVerification() helper
- After ghEditLabels, re-reads issue with ghViewIssue
- Verifies all added labels present and removed labels absent
- On failure: returns LABEL_VERIFICATION_FAILED → MANUAL_REVIEW_REQUIRED

--- Fix 3: tryRemove result checking ---
- All tryRemove() callers now check return value before recording actions
- cleanupStaleArtifacts() only records successful removals
- Stale heartbeat path only records successful removals

